<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<meta http-equiv="Content-Security-Policy"
  content="default-src 'none'; style-src 'unsafe-inline'; img-src 'self' data:; script-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline';">
<meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow">
<meta name="referrer" content="no-referrer">
<meta http-equiv="Cache-Control" content="no-cache, no-store, must-revalidate">
<meta http-equiv="Pragma" content="no-cache">
<meta http-equiv="Expires" content="0">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>502 Bad Gateway</title>
  <style>
    body {
      margin: 0;
      background-color: #111;
      color: #eee;
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      height: 100vh;
      text-align: center;
    }
  
    .logo {
      display: none;
      position: relative;
      width: 250px;
      height: 250px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      border: 0px solid #bbb;
      /* background: radial-gradient(#222, #000); */
      box-shadow: 0 0 25px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
      margin-bottom: 30px;
    }
  
    .logo img {
      position: absolute;
      top: 50%;
      left: 50%;
      transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
      width: 99%;
      height: 99%;
    }
  
    .message {
      font-size: 1.3rem;
      max-width: 600px;
      padding: 0 20px;
      line-height: 1.6;
      color: #ccc;
      text-shadow: #757575 0 0 1px;
    }
  
    .message h1 {
      margin: 10px;
      opacity: 0.3;
      color: #ccc;
      text-shadow: #757575 0 0 0.5px;
    }
  
    .history {
      display: none;
      max-width: 800px;
      margin: 20px;
      font-size: 1rem;
      line-height: 1.7;
      color: rgb(134, 134, 134);
      text-shadow: #757575 0 0 1px;
    }
  
    @media screen and (min-width: 1000px) and (min-height: 850px) {
      .logo {
        display: block;
      }
  
      .history {
        display: block;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>
  <div class="logo">
    <img
      src="data:image/png;base64,"
      alt="Error" />
  </div>
  <div class="message">
    <h1>502 Bad Gateway</h1>
    This error response means that the server, while working as a gateway to get a response needed to handle the request, got an invalid response.
  </div>
  <div class="history">
    <p>
      In 1955, at the 24 Hours of Le Mans, the Mercedes-Benz 300 SLRs roared with unmatched power. But during the race, one tragic signal was misunderstood, and a moment’s miscommunication changed motorsport forever.
    </p>
    <p>
      Machines rely on precision — and on perfect connection. Something was lost in transmission this time.
    </p>
    <p>
      We’re restoring the link.
    </p>
    <p>
      Please refresh the page shortly.
    </p>
    <p style="margin-top: 20px; font-style: italic;">
      — Inspired by the lessons of Le Mans 1955
    </p>
  </div>
</body>

</html>